{"id":"ce6232bb24c8b547","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-implicant.md","title":"Implicant relation","display":"df-implicant — Implicant relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-implicant","aliases":["27-df-implicant"],"display":"df-implicant — Implicant relation","depends_on":["[[27-df-impset]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-implicant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-implicant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implicant — Implicant relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> (implicant set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Implicant}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Implicant}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Implicant}(T,f)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Implicant}(T,f)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(a)\\leq f(a)\">\\(T(a)\\leq f(a)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-impset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ (implicant set, see [[27-df-impset]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Implicant}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Term}_n\\times\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Implicant}(T,f)\\leftrightarrow T\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"T(a)\\leq f(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}","display":false}],"bytes":786,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-implicant|df-implicant — Implicant relation]]"}],"outgoing":["e9e30bad3bbd56ff"]}